#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/rocm/intrinsics/mfma_layout/index.rst:112
msgid ""
"For v_mfma_i32_32x32x32_i8 (gfx950), each wave-64 lane holds 16 output i32 "
"values.  The row (M-dimension) is indexed by ``thread_id % 32`` and the "
"column (N-dimension) is given by the interleaved formula below. This "
"function returns ``(m_idx, n_idx)`` matching the ``(row, col)`` convention "
"expected by ``stmatrix``."
msgstr ""
